ったり...タピオカ飲んだり............"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中からせっちゃん(宮澤せいらちゃん)合流したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯は、鍋たべて、焼き鳥たべて、デザート何個もたべたり........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく食べ過ぎてお腹パンパン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや族さんからもダイエットはよくないから沢山食べて、よく運動して、バランスよく食べたら良いよ♪っていってもらえたし〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はせいたんがお泊まりにくるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワク"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.