02/12/6505832/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(高山かずみちゃん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバースデェ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ一緒にいてホッコリするし、\n和むし楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたやぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくねっ(^з^)-☆アイラブユー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが元気になるコメントをいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も大きな独り言言いながら読んだよ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日の方、まあやのおめでとう♪♪が聞こえた!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な１年になりますように...と、まあやと出逢ってくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しは次回絶対します(*_*)sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、畠中ちゃんと私は\n今日から同じ１つ屋根のしたで冬眠する事になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中ちゃんは、寝てる時に寝言を言うでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも朝までグッスリ静かに寝てたでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/12/6505832/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}